<title>USA: IPO FILING - Champion Mortgage Holdings.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Champion Mortgage Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name  Champion Mortgage Holdings Corp</p>
<p> Stock symbol			CMPN.O</p>
<p> Estimated price range	   N/A</p>
<p> Total shares to be offered    3.5 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by company	 3.5 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by shareholders  Nil</p>
<p> Shrs outstanding after ipo    15 million</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter    Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  525,000 shrs Business: (Retail mortgage banker that originates, sells and services higher-yielding home equity mortgage loans, mainly on one- to four-unit residential properties.) Use of Proceeds: To fund an $11.4 million distribution of current holders, to repay about $10.2 million in notes payable to certainholders, to pay about $45.4 million outstanding under a line of credit and other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p> Financial Data in 000s:    1996		  1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $67,379	     $34,998</p>
<p>   - Net Income	    $16,343		($275)</p>
